<title>USA: Mexico FY 97 farm credit offer due Oct 1 -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico FY 97 farm credit offer due Oct 1 -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's fiscal 1997 allocation of credit guarantees for farm exports will be announced around October 1, USDA's grain and feed division head Bob Riemenshneider said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Speaking on USDA radio, Riemenshneider declined to say how much the allocation would be, but said he expected Mexico to continue to be a good user of the credit guarantee programs.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8394</p>
</text>
